OL,5,G0200 Nina Simone: Live At Montreux 1976
OL,6,     FThe High Priestess of Soul gives a
OL,7,     Fpowerful performance at the 1976
OL,8,     FMontreux Jazz Festival, featuring
OL,9,     Fa selection of great songs,
OL,10,     Fincluding Little Girl Blue and I
OL,11,     FWish I Knew How.
OL,12,G0310 Ella Fitzgerald: Just One Of Those
OL,13,G     Things
OL,14,     FDocumentary on the life of jazz
OL,15,     Fsinger Ella Fitzgerald, showcasing
OL,16,     Fher impact on civil rights and her
OL,17,     Flasting legacy. From
OL,18,     FEmmy-nominated filmmaker Leslie
OL,19,     FWoodhead.
